(284433, 20155, 4494, '<td valign="top">I think I know who this is from because of the top pic of the pier. :)  This is an eye catching shot with good advertising in it.  But, the words might be a little small when printed as a 3 x 5 sticker.  But GREAT effort!  7.</td>', 'I think I know who this is from because of the top pic of the pier. :)  This is an eye catching shot with good advertising in it.  But, the words might be a little small when printed as a 3 x 5 sticker.  But GREAT effort!  7.', '2003-05-01 02:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
