(284695, 19952, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent. My highest rated prints sticker. Its simple, to the point, and eye catching with that one bit of yellow too. The Get Hung! catchphrase works well too :)<br/>I would suggest moving or resizing the frame slightly to make sure the little part of the ''t'' doesnt keep coming on the right of it tho, as this looks a bit distracting.</td>', 'Excellent. My highest rated prints sticker. Its simple, to the point, and eye catching with that one bit of yellow too. The Get Hung! catchphrase works well too :)I would suggest moving or resizing the frame slightly to make sure the little part of the ''t'' doesnt keep coming on the right of it tho, as this looks a bit distracting.', '2003-05-01 12:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(284699, 19825, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this design, with colour on the right and b&amp;w on the left. I do think that the images are slightly too close to the edge tho. The overall simple design works well.</td>', 'I like this design, with colour on the right and b&w on the left. I do think that the images are slightly too close to the edge tho. The overall simple design works well.', '2003-05-01 12:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(284704, 20153, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent design. The brush stroke looks great for art (not sure how I would know its about photography tho) and the monotone looks really good.</td>', 'Excellent design. The brush stroke looks great for art (not sure how I would know its about photography tho) and the monotone looks really good.', '2003-05-01 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(284707, 19795, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think there are too many colours in this, which looks kinda confusing, but the design is bold and simple, which looks good overall.</td>', 'I think there are too many colours in this, which looks kinda confusing, but the design is bold and simple, which looks good overall.', '2003-05-01 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(284711, 19811, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the slogan. I think there are too many different fonts used tho which makes it seem too busy. If you had done the URL in the same font as the slogan I think this would look better.</td>', 'I like the slogan. I think there are too many different fonts used tho which makes it seem too busy. If you had done the URL in the same font as the slogan I think this would look better.', '2003-05-01 12:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(284712, 19626, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the choice of font. I don''t think the R is very clear. I like the rest of the design tho, except that the dotted camera may look a little too busy.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the choice of font. I don''t think the R is very clear. I like the rest of the design tho, except that the dotted camera may look a little too busy.', '2003-05-01 12:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(284721, 20064, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of colour on the font, which goes well with the sepia photo. That really makes the ''Prints!'' stand out nicely. I like the (then print me) but I think that you could do without the word ''at''. I think it kinda spoils the flow of the text. I also think that because you have included a comma in the slogan, you should alsp punctuate it at the end with a !</td>', 'Nice choice of colour on the font, which goes well with the sepia photo. That really makes the ''Prints!'' stand out nicely. I like the (then print me) but I think that you could do without the word ''at''. I think it kinda spoils the flow of the text. I also think that because you have included a comma in the slogan, you should alsp punctuate it at the end with a !', '2003-05-01 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(284726, 19799, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the blue that goes throughout this design. I''s very eyepleasing. I think the ''Prints!'' should be a little bolder, but thats just my opinion. I''m also not too keen on the bevel of the URL. The bevel on the logo looks good though.</td>', 'I like the blue that goes throughout this design. I''s very eyepleasing. I think the ''Prints!'' should be a little bolder, but thats just my opinion. I''m also not too keen on the bevel of the URL. The bevel on the logo looks good though.', '2003-05-01 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(284730, 20140, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think there is too much information and not enough initial impact. While it does show what dpcprints is more than some other designs, I think it lacks something that will draw peoples attention. Perhaps it is that the only pictures present are only very small and dotted around in no particular order.</td>', 'Nice, but I think there is too much information and not enough initial impact. While it does show what dpcprints is more than some other designs, I think it lacks something that will draw peoples attention. Perhaps it is that the only pictures present are only very small and dotted around in no particular order.', '2003-05-01 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(284733, 19418, 2780, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I dont associate the ''dpc'' as part of the URL. If I was to see this I would think it was advertising //www.prints.com</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I dont associate the ''dpc'' as part of the URL. If I was to see this I would think it was advertising //www.prints.com', '2003-05-01 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(284735, 20137, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well done... Says it all simply and clearly.</td>', 'Well done... Says it all simply and clearly.', '2003-05-01 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(284742, 20140, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Clearly states what the site´s about :)</td>', 'Well done!  Clearly states what the site´s about :)', '2003-05-01 12:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(284747, 19945, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the white of the ''dpchallenge'' mixes in too much with that background that it is over. Perhaps a black outline around the text would improve this. I also feel that tehre are too many different parts of this photo, and I think getting rid of the snails and having some blank space there would help a lot.<br/> <br/>Also I''m not sure that dpcprints IS actually the largest collection of printed photo artwork on line (yet!) so this would be illegal under false advertising. (Maybe I''m wrong)</td>', 'I think the white of the ''dpchallenge'' mixes in too much with that background that it is over. Perhaps a black outline around the text would improve this. I also feel that tehre are too many different parts of this photo, and I think getting rid of the snails and having some blank space there would help a lot. Also I''m not sure that dpcprints IS actually the largest collection of printed photo artwork on line (yet!) so this would be illegal under false advertising. (Maybe I''m wrong)', '2003-05-01 12:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(284748, 19930, 2780, '<td valign="top">Doh! I think you entered this into the wrong challenge!</td>', 'Doh! I think you entered this into the wrong challenge!', '2003-05-01 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(284753, 19957, 2780, '<td valign="top">The first thing that hits me when looking at this is that the images aren''t centered. The second thing is the colouring in the ''dpchallenge''. I''ve never been a fan of mixing yellow and blue, which is just a personal preference.  I think the bevel on the ''Prints!'' looks pretty good, but on dpchallenge it just doesnt work as well. I think for bevel to look good it needs the right font.</td>', 'The first thing that hits me when looking at this is that the images aren''t centered. The second thing is the colouring in the ''dpchallenge''. I''ve never been a fan of mixing yellow and blue, which is just a personal preference.  I think the bevel on the ''Prints!'' looks pretty good, but on dpchallenge it just doesnt work as well. I think for bevel to look good it needs the right font.', '2003-05-01 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(284757, 20037, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the photo in the background, but I dont think the slogan in the top left is easy enough to see. Also,  I like the idea of mixing up the letters in ''Prints!'' but it seems too busy and crowded down in that corner now.</td>', 'I like the photo in the background, but I dont think the slogan in the top left is easy enough to see. Also,  I like the idea of mixing up the letters in ''Prints!'' but it seems too busy and crowded down in that corner now.', '2003-05-01 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(284761, 19649, 2780, '<td valign="top">If the wall was a more natural colour i think I would like it more, but it seems to have a blue cast over it. Also, I''m not too keen on the bevelling, but thats just my opinion.<br/> <br/>A nice simple design idea, but the bevel and busy background makes it look cluttered and hard to read easily.</td>', 'If the wall was a more natural colour i think I would like it more, but it seems to have a blue cast over it. Also, I''m not too keen on the bevelling, but thats just my opinion. A nice simple design idea, but the bevel and busy background makes it look cluttered and hard to read easily.', '2003-05-01 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(284764, 19580, 4517, '<td valign="top">Photo to low res. If they sold prints like this i don`t think they would make much money.</td>', 'Photo to low res. If they sold prints like this i don`t think they would make much money.', '2003-05-01 12:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(284768, 20155, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this is too busy. My eyes don''t know where to look. Altho it shows a nice variety of photographs, I just think it looks too cluttered, especially with all the copyright stuff in there too, which imo is un-neccessary and just makes it even more confusing.<br/> <br/>Also, the URL is unclear to me. The // part is not really needed (and to a lesser extent nor is the www) and the direction that it goes in, from bottom to top, seems unnatural.</td>', 'I think this is too busy. My eyes don''t know where to look. Altho it shows a nice variety of photographs, I just think it looks too cluttered, especially with all the copyright stuff in there too, which imo is un-neccessary and just makes it even more confusing. Also, the URL is unclear to me. The // part is not really needed (and to a lesser extent nor is the www) and the direction that it goes in, from bottom to top, seems unnatural.', '2003-05-01 12:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(284771, 20102, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice flowing design but unfortunatly the wrong size for the challenge.<br/> <br/>Also you wrote dpcchallenge. (one too many c''s)</td>', 'Nice flowing design but unfortunatly the wrong size for the challenge. Also you wrote dpcchallenge. (one too many c''s)', '2003-05-01 12:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(284774, 20137, 2780, '<td valign="top">To me this looks like it should all be centered, but they are all slightly off in different directions. I like the simpleness of it but I think it needs a little something else to give it more impact.</td>', 'To me this looks like it should all be centered, but they are all slightly off in different directions. I like the simpleness of it but I think it needs a little something else to give it more impact.', '2003-05-01 12:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(284778, 20063, 2780, '<td valign="top">I dont really see the relevance of the photo you used. Also it doesnt look in focus, and I can see some smudging in the bottom left :(</td>', 'I dont really see the relevance of the photo you used. Also it doesnt look in focus, and I can see some smudging in the bottom left :(', '2003-05-01 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(284780, 19405, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wow! Colour overload! My initial reaction here is:<br/>"What on Earth is going on?!"<br/>I also don''t like the fact that all the large URLs are cut off at the end.</td>', 'Wow! Colour overload! My initial reaction here is:"What on Earth is going on?!"I also don''t like the fact that all the large URLs are cut off at the end.', '2003-05-01 12:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
