(284811, 20064, 6900, '<td valign="top">This is likely the winner on dpcp.  I love it, it''s funny and you picked a great shot to use for this phrase.  All around nice job.</td>', 'This is likely the winner on dpcp.  I love it, it''s funny and you picked a great shot to use for this phrase.  All around nice job.', '2003-05-01 12:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
