(286671, 19945, 1031, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if your claim is accurate or hyperbolic, but at least you say what it''s about! I don''t know if the snails were the wisest choice of subject but they look great...good overall collage too.</td>', 'Don''t know if your claim is accurate or hyperbolic, but at least you say what it''s about! I don''t know if the snails were the wisest choice of subject but they look great...good overall collage too.', '2003-05-03 21:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(286672, 19825, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job using the photos...guess I think the right one should be just a little away from the edge like the other one.</td>', 'Good job using the photos...guess I think the right one should be just a little away from the edge like the other one.', '2003-05-03 21:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(286673, 20102, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like this would fit 2-up on the specified size -- could save on printing costs...</td>', 'Looks like this would fit 2-up on the specified size -- could save on printing costs...', '2003-05-03 21:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(286675, 19811, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good humor.</td>', 'Good idea, good humor.', '2003-05-03 21:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286677, 19405, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very attention-getting...could maybe use one more line of type explaining it is photos for sale...</td>', 'Very attention-getting...could maybe use one more line of type explaining it is photos for sale...', '2003-05-03 21:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286679, 20119, 1031, '<td valign="top">Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it''s photographic prints for sale -- don''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to "outsiders."</td>', 'Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it''s photographic prints for sale -- don''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to "outsiders."', '2003-05-03 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(286682, 20064, 1031, '<td valign="top">Covers the info pretty well, exotic subject attracts attention. Seems more targeted towards attracting photographers than print-buying customers, which is a somewhat different slant than most.</td>', 'Covers the info pretty well, exotic subject attracts attention. Seems more targeted towards attracting photographers than print-buying customers, which is a somewhat different slant than most.', '2003-05-03 21:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(286684, 19957, 1031, '<td valign="top">A similar idea to mine, but a cleaner design. Might have flipped the bison and made the sample photos a touch bigger -- I think there is enough space to do that by spreading the type out without it looking cluttered. Good job!</td>', 'A similar idea to mine, but a cleaner design. Might have flipped the bison and made the sample photos a touch bigger -- I think there is enough space to do that by spreading the type out without it looking cluttered. Good job!', '2003-05-03 21:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286687, 19626, 1031, '<td valign="top">Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it\''s photographic prints for sale -- don\''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to \"outsiders.\" In fact, using a motif of what looks like halftone dots somewhat implies lithographic prints rather than photos. I like the overall design a lot, just question its suitability for this particular challenge...</td>', 'Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it\''s photographic prints for sale -- don\''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to \"outsiders.\" In fact, using a motif of what looks like halftone dots somewhat implies lithographic prints rather than photos. I like the overall design a lot, just question its suitability for this particular challenge...', '2003-05-03 21:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(286688, 19799, 1031, '<td valign="top">Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it\''s photographic prints for sale -- don\''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to \"outsiders.\"</td>', 'Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it\''s photographic prints for sale -- don\''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to \"outsiders.\"', '2003-05-03 21:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(286689, 20063, 1031, '<td valign="top">Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it\''s photographic prints for sale -- don\''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to \"outsiders.\" At least you included a photo!</td>', 'Like many entries, I think this could use one more line specifically explaining it\''s photographic prints for sale -- don\''t think it would be clear or enticing enough to \"outsiders.\" At least you included a photo!', '2003-05-03 21:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(286808, 20037, 8442, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite, but the problme is the font used for "Preserve that perfect momen". The font is in my opinion a bad choice and the text is lost in the background. Is the good path but must to be improved.</td>', 'This is my favorite, but the problme is the font used for "Preserve that perfect momen". The font is in my opinion a bad choice and the text is lost in the background. Is the good path but must to be improved.', '2003-05-04 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
