(290329, 20102, 806, '<td valign="top">like the graphics in this. clean, simple. nice.</td>', 'like the graphics in this. clean, simple. nice.', '2003-05-07 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(290333, 19811, 806, '<td valign="top">This evokes an idea for a whole commercial! (I know, I know.. we are not quite there yet).. but, imagine someone pondering what to hang on their wall at home or at the office. They walk away, and the wall morphs and extends it''s hands to the computer, all the time the face of the wall looks around to be sure no one is looking, and types the address on the nearby computer. Quickly, the wall retracts, as the person comes back, and smiles and says "That''s it! Glad I thought of it!" LOL<br/>I know, I know, you must think I am nuts. But I had to type this out!<br/>I like how your idea can evoke this kind of imagery, and how it is clean and simple.</td>', 'This evokes an idea for a whole commercial! (I know, I know.. we are not quite there yet).. but, imagine someone pondering what to hang on their wall at home or at the office. They walk away, and the wall morphs and extends it''s hands to the computer, all the time the face of the wall looks around to be sure no one is looking, and types the address on the nearby computer. Quickly, the wall retracts, as the person comes back, and smiles and says "That''s it! Glad I thought of it!" LOLI know, I know, you must think I am nuts. But I had to type this out!I like how your idea can evoke this kind of imagery, and how it is clean and simple.', '2003-05-07 10:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(291483, 19825, 3747, '<td valign="top">I like this design, the photo corners are nice, but I''d prefer them to look more like traditional photo corners. There should definitely be more white space around the outside of the sticker. Good stuff.</td>', 'I like this design, the photo corners are nice, but I''d prefer them to look more like traditional photo corners. There should definitely be more white space around the outside of the sticker. Good stuff.', '2003-05-07 22:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(291486, 20064, 3747, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites! I love the picture. The only criticism I have is that I''d like the main text to be a little different. I think it should say "Go ahead, take your best shot (then print it) at ...," plus the main text coudl be a different color, maybe closer to the "Prints!" color. Very nice.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites! I love the picture. The only criticism I have is that I''d like the main text to be a little different. I think it should say "Go ahead, take your best shot (then print it) at ...," plus the main text coudl be a different color, maybe closer to the "Prints!" color. Very nice.', '2003-05-07 22:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(291490, 20153, 3747, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good choice. It''s very simple, minimalistic, nice.</td>', 'I think this is a good choice. It''s very simple, minimalistic, nice.', '2003-05-07 22:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(291513, 19952, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!  Effective, simple, to the point.</td>', 'Good job!  Effective, simple, to the point.', '2003-05-07 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
